  <p>Server and security records may be retained for the period needed to operate and protect the site. If analytics are added in the future, this page will be updated to identify them and explain what is collected. Questions about this notice can be sent to <a href="mailto:singhsurinderny@gmail.com">singhsurinderny@gmail.com</a>. This notice was last updated on August 23, 2026.</p>
